  ],
  "resultNote": "These are five separate continuous self-described personality traits, each scored 10–50 with a keyed item mean of 1–5. There is no combined personality score, population percentile, fixed personality type, diagnosis or fitness threshold. Intellect/Imagination is a personality factor, not an IQ or intelligence test. Emotional Stability is scored in the source's direction, not relabelled as Neuroticism. Without suitable population norms these raw scores do not identify you as low, average or high compared with others."
